  "isolation": "One isolated test instance per phase (scripts/macos/test-instance.mjs): fresh data folder and WKWebView store under the run folder, projects in folders under the run folder created through the Projects panel (folder dialog answered by the IPC trace), the pinned engine with MUSE_NO_AUTO_UPDATE=1; each phase's stop records the default stores unchanged and no process left. The engine's session store is shared with the user (ADR 0003).",
  "method": "Real 1.4.2 turns. The approval recipe is a shell write with a variable argument (m='<tag>'; printf ... > probe.txt), which the host cannot clear statically; the question recipes call request_user_input with fixed ids and options. Clicks are real mouse events through the bridge (Input.dispatchMouseEvent, isTrusted), first messages are typed (Input.insertText) and sent with Enter. Decisions and answers are counted on the page's IPC transport (window.__baselineIpc); host state is read through list_pending_requests. The 'same id in two conversations' cases copy A's exact tool_request / input_request event into B's poll_events response, the path every bridge event takes to the renderer. Incidents: Page.reload, SIGKILL of the app, SIGKILL of one engine with the app open, a graceful close from the window (Tauri window close).",
  "posture": "Ask -> promptUnmatched, no client auto-approval (decision 05/10); the reject phase switches to the middle posture (onRequest) and back with a card pending",
